// A forest sprite that staffs a building of its job. It carries nothing.
// Out of a building, an enemy's swings hurt it: three hits kill it, and it
// comes back beside the tree 900 frames (15 s) later, keeping its job
// (SACRED_TREE_BALLISTA.md, B6). Drawn by the worker skin until it has its
// own.
(
    sim: (
        brain: Sprite,
        body: (radius: 0.22),
        movement: (walk: 1.6),
        sprite: (health: 3, respawn: 900),
    ),
    view: (skin: "worker"),
)
